WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.350
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.370
No being ominous in the corner!

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.720
Okay, who let Dr. Bright watch The Blair Witch
Project?

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.850
I know it was one of you.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.950
Ever since he saw it, he's been standing in
the corner of dark rooms, facing the wall,

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.870
and freaking everybody out!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.060
He's just twiddling his thumbs and laughing
to himself while he does it, but it's creepy.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:27.160
It's ominous, it's disconcerting, and it's
negatively affecting productivity in the workplace.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:27.830
Cut it out!

